---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
const lang = 'en';
---
<Base
  title="About"
  description="Cartagena Up is a locally verified guide to Cartagena, Colombia — maintained by someone who lives here."
  lang="en"
  canonicalUrl="https://cartagenaup.com/about/">

  <div style="padding-top: 2rem;">
    <h1 style="font-family: Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 1.875rem; color: var(--fg); margin: 0 0 1.75rem; line-height: 1.2;">
      About Cartagena Up
    </h1>

    <div style="font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--fg); line-height: 1.75; display: grid; gap: 1.25rem;">
      <p style="margin: 0;">
        Cartagena Up is maintained by two locals:
      </p>
      <p style="margin: 0;">
        <strong>Yatan</strong> has lived in Cartagena since 2021 and works remotely from the city. He tests WiFi speeds and runs <a href="https://casagaviota.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #C45C26; text-decoration: none;">Casa Gaviota</a>, a private beach house in Barú.
      </p>
      <p style="margin: 0;">
        <strong>Adri</strong> has lived in Cartagena since 2010 — longer than almost any guide writer covering this city. She verifies cafés, knows the neighborhoods, and brings fifteen years of local knowledge to every listing.
      </p>
      <p style="margin: 0;">
        Every listing on this site was visited in person. Every WiFi speed is a real measurement.
      </p>
      <h2 id="how-we-test" style="font-family: Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 1.375rem; margin: 0.75rem 0 0; color: var(--fg);">How we test</h2>
      <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 1.25rem; display: grid; gap: 0.5rem;">
        <li>Every spot is visited in person by Yatan or Adri — no listings from photos, reviews, or press releases.</li>
        <li>WiFi is measured on the spot with <a href="https://www.speedtest.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #C45C26; text-decoration: none;">Speedtest.net</a> to the nearest Cartagena server. We publish download, upload, and ping exactly as measured — never rounded or estimated.</li>
        <li>Each listing shows the date it was tested and who tested it. Speeds vary with time of day and how busy a place is, so treat them as a real snapshot, not a guarantee.</li>
        <li>Outlets, noise, AC, and the best time to go are what we saw on the visit. Places that close are kept and marked closed, so old links still tell you the truth.</li>
        <li>Spotted something out of date? Tell us on WhatsApp and we'll re-test.</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin: 0;">
        Something wrong or out of date? <a href="https://wa.me/573163946401?text=Hi! I want to send feedback about Cartagena Up." target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #C45C26; text-decoration: none;">Tell us on WhatsApp.</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

</Base>
